 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -9 & 4\\end{aligned}|+(-8)\\cdot (-1)^{4+2}\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-7\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -9 & 4\\end{aligned}|-8\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
